<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The goal screens (features/settings impl goals/, libraries/goals/ui): setting any goal, the goal
  page with its week and projection, and the reveal when a goal is set. Onboarding's goal question
  reuses the libraries/goals/ui pieces and their strings.

  Eating-disorder sensitive, as strings_goal.xml: never praise eating less, never hurry anyone,
  never say a day was failed or must be made up for. Projections are rough and say so. A number
  followed by "calories" is a calorie amount to the leak test, so those lines only show where
  calories do. Same rules as strings.xml: no backslash escapes, positional %1$s.
-->
